          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.05.02-S020",
          "text": "护照不在包里了。",
          "meaning_my": "ပတ်စ်ပို့က အိတ်ထဲမှာ မရှိတော့ဘူး။",
